(3490513, 488399, 30982, '<td valign="top">Poker is definitely an "in" thing these days.  Compelling, well done shot IMO.  I like the focus, both literally and in the guy''s expression.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Poker is definitely an "in" thing these days.  Compelling, well done shot IMO.  I like the focus, both literally and in the guy''s expression.  Nicely done.', '2007-03-27 05:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490515, 487689, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of those trends that''s sticking around a bit longer than I thought it would.  Good, umm, view of that trend.  The processing has kind of eliminated detail from the surface of the jeans.</td>', 'One of those trends that''s sticking around a bit longer than I thought it would.  Good, umm, view of that trend.  The processing has kind of eliminated detail from the surface of the jeans.', '2007-03-27 05:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490519, 487613, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, crisp shot.</td>', 'Good lighting, crisp shot.', '2007-03-27 05:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490521, 488390, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve definitely got most stuff covered!  Lighting is a bit too low/shot underexposed for my taste.  Levels bringing in the slider on the left might make all the difference.</td>', 'You''ve definitely got most stuff covered!  Lighting is a bit too low/shot underexposed for my taste.  Levels bringing in the slider on the left might make all the difference.', '2007-03-27 05:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490525, 487043, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi, I''m an addict.  Nice work platering the cup with stickers!  Good in-your-face composition (if that''s what you''re after) but a less centered comp might add more interest/balance overall.  In this case, I can also see some more dramatic lighting with a long shadow to add symbolism, too.  Good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Hi, I''m an addict.  Nice work platering the cup with stickers!  Good in-your-face composition (if that''s what you''re after) but a less centered comp might add more interest/balance overall.  In this case, I can also see some more dramatic lighting with a long shadow to add symbolism, too.  Good idea for the challenge.', '2007-03-27 05:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490526, 487667, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the subject.  Star Wars is one of those things that''s been around awhile, but still endures.</td>', 'Good shot of the subject.  Star Wars is one of those things that''s been around awhile, but still endures.', '2007-03-27 05:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490529, 488445, 30982, '<td valign="top">I still don''t own one of these things, but I do understand they''re quite popular.  :-)  I like the focus on the earpiece - different approach.</td>', 'I still don''t own one of these things, but I do understand they''re quite popular.  :-)  I like the focus on the earpiece - different approach.', '2007-03-27 05:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490531, 488370, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oooh - vinyl!  It''s making a comeback, you know.  Good selection - I''ve owned quite a few of those myself.  As a picture, it shows what you want it to show but doesn''t have a great deal of "kick" to it.  Not sure how to make something like this have more "kick", though.</td>', 'Oooh - vinyl!  It''s making a comeback, you know.  Good selection - I''ve owned quite a few of those myself.  As a picture, it shows what you want it to show but doesn''t have a great deal of "kick" to it.  Not sure how to make something like this have more "kick", though.', '2007-03-27 05:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490532, 486776, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate for the challenge and a nice shot, too.</td>', 'Very appropriate for the challenge and a nice shot, too.', '2007-03-27 05:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490535, 488439, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well balanced still life.  Lighting is pretty good, thought the brightness of the center disk in front is a bit overpowering with respect to the rest of the image.</td>', 'Well balanced still life.  Lighting is pretty good, thought the brightness of the center disk in front is a bit overpowering with respect to the rest of the image.', '2007-03-27 05:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490546, 488409, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits with pop culture, but it''s definitely a different kind of portrait.  Well lit, well shot.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits with pop culture, but it''s definitely a different kind of portrait.  Well lit, well shot.', '2007-03-27 06:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490548, 488318, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like the juxtaposition of the not-young ladies (i''m gettin'' there, too, so I don''t say "old") against the graffiti, generally thought of as done by younger people.  The golden tones of this are wonderful.</td>', 'I very much like the juxtaposition of the not-young ladies (i''m gettin'' there, too, so I don''t say "old") against the graffiti, generally thought of as done by younger people.  The golden tones of this are wonderful.', '2007-03-27 06:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490550, 488457, 30982, '<td valign="top">This says "Qart" to me, but very well could be someone else''s.  Great work all around.</td>', 'This says "Qart" to me, but very well could be someone else''s.  Great work all around.', '2007-03-27 06:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490552, 488326, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gosh I hope that amp was defunct to begin with!  Nice location for a shoot and nice result!</td>', 'Gosh I hope that amp was defunct to begin with!  Nice location for a shoot and nice result!', '2007-03-27 06:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490553, 488221, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for the challenge - good shot, too.</td>', 'Nice choice for the challenge - good shot, too.', '2007-03-27 06:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490554, 487879, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good play on words executed visually and the angle creates an interesting tension.</td>', 'Good play on words executed visually and the angle creates an interesting tension.', '2007-03-27 06:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490555, 488077, 30982, '<td valign="top">A busy shot that works well, in my opinion.  I think the desat would be fine without the red counter, but it does provide a nice counterline to the yellow arch.  Obnoxious thing, that arch, isn''t it?</td>', 'A busy shot that works well, in my opinion.  I think the desat would be fine without the red counter, but it does provide a nice counterline to the yellow arch.  Obnoxious thing, that arch, isn''t it?', '2007-03-27 06:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490558, 488074, 57229, '<td valign="top">A quick run through the entries shows that maybe ''pop culture'' is too nebulous a concept for people to agree on. The innocent(?) bystander here really helps to set it off and define it. 8</td>', 'A quick run through the entries shows that maybe ''pop culture'' is too nebulous a concept for people to agree on. The innocent(?) bystander here really helps to set it off and define it. 8', '2007-03-27 06:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490559, 487619, 57229, '<td valign="top">Really doesn''t lift my heart to see this picture. Shame, that, because the picture quality and the fact that it addresses the challenge right between the eyes gets you 8 anyway :)</td>', 'Really doesn''t lift my heart to see this picture. Shame, that, because the picture quality and the fact that it addresses the challenge right between the eyes gets you 8 anyway :)', '2007-03-27 06:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490560, 488462, 57229, '<td valign="top">Bum bonus - 6</td>', 'Bum bonus - 6', '2007-03-27 06:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490566, 488318, 57229, '<td valign="top">The defensive stances of the little ladies sets this one of especially well. It''s like they''re battling against a hail of grafitti. Aren''t we all :) Very Bresson. 8</td>', 'The defensive stances of the little ladies sets this one of especially well. It''s like they''re battling against a hail of grafitti. Aren''t we all :) Very Bresson. 8', '2007-03-27 06:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490573, 488253, 30982, '<td valign="top">DPC isn''t fond of title-dependent entries (I know from experience) but this is indeed kinda cute!  A bit soft on focus, maybe, but definitely a different idea!</td>', 'DPC isn''t fond of title-dependent entries (I know from experience) but this is indeed kinda cute!  A bit soft on focus, maybe, but definitely a different idea!', '2007-03-27 06:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490576, 488424, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good "ad" type shot.  Good light, nice use of condensation.  Not entirely sure about the crop - I seem to want to nudge the can over to the right just a bit.</td>', 'Good "ad" type shot.  Good light, nice use of condensation.  Not entirely sure about the crop - I seem to want to nudge the can over to the right just a bit.', '2007-03-27 06:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490577, 488330, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hard Rock Cafe pins?  Took me a minute to figure out what they were.  Nice collection!  Nice light on the shot, too.</td>', 'Hard Rock Cafe pins?  Took me a minute to figure out what they were.  Nice collection!  Nice light on the shot, too.', '2007-03-27 06:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490578, 488310, 30982, '<td valign="top">When I view shots, I don''t look at the titles at first - I thought this was in the wrong challenge and meant for Color Portrait.  With the title, I get an idea of where you''re going with it, but to really make it work, you probably needed to take it WAY over the top on editing - make her very plastic.</td>', 'When I view shots, I don''t look at the titles at first - I thought this was in the wrong challenge and meant for Color Portrait.  With the title, I get an idea of where you''re going with it, but to really make it work, you probably needed to take it WAY over the top on editing - make her very plastic.', '2007-03-27 06:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490579, 488444, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m going with the Pop Culture reference being on their T-shirts.  And the somewhat odd correlation of folks wearing these type of T-shirts going for a hike in the woods?  Processing is a little strong for my taste but does add an interesting feel to the shot.</td>', 'I''m going with the Pop Culture reference being on their T-shirts.  And the somewhat odd correlation of folks wearing these type of T-shirts going for a hike in the woods?  Processing is a little strong for my taste but does add an interesting feel to the shot.', '2007-03-27 06:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490581, 488142, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good idea, well executed, might be Larus (except it''s all in English).</td>', 'Good idea, well executed, might be Larus (except it''s all in English).', '2007-03-27 06:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490582, 488075, 57229, '<td valign="top">Maybe I shouldn''t, but I just have to mark this down for being tasteless, popular only to a minority culture and aimed mockingly at the underdog. It''s a lousy picture, too - 2</td>', 'Maybe I shouldn''t, but I just have to mark this down for being tasteless, popular only to a minority culture and aimed mockingly at the underdog. It''s a lousy picture, too - 2', '2007-03-27 06:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490586, 486239, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like that you got such different looks from the same shoot.  The Color Portrait looks very waif-like, shy, unsure.  Here, you''re quite self-assured, very cool indeed.  Love the color-tones you do with these, and this is very nicely framed/cropped.</td>', 'I like that you got such different looks from the same shoot.  The Color Portrait looks very waif-like, shy, unsure.  Here, you''re quite self-assured, very cool indeed.  Love the color-tones you do with these, and this is very nicely framed/cropped.', '2007-03-27 06:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490587, 488381, 30982, '<td valign="top">Those would be the very lovely eyes of Hopper''s wife, I''m guessing.  Nice how they match the Starbucks cup green, too!  It''s an addiction, not a pop culture thing!  :-)</td>', 'Those would be the very lovely eyes of Hopper''s wife, I''m guessing.  Nice how they match the Starbucks cup green, too!  It''s an addiction, not a pop culture thing!  :-)', '2007-03-27 06:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490588, 488367, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if its Pop Culture or just teen rebellion, but it works.  I like the almost shy look despite the punked appearance.</td>', 'I don''t know if its Pop Culture or just teen rebellion, but it works.  I like the almost shy look despite the punked appearance.', '2007-03-27 06:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490589, 487520, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite representative!</td>', 'Quite representative!', '2007-03-27 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490590, 487299, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''d consider this an entry in the Color Portrait challenge - very good portrait, lovely color, nice work on the "make the eyes sparkle" bit.  Add the sunglasses, the title, and voila, pop culture!</td>', 'Without the title, I''d consider this an entry in the Color Portrait challenge - very good portrait, lovely color, nice work on the "make the eyes sparkle" bit.  Add the sunglasses, the title, and voila, pop culture!', '2007-03-27 06:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490592, 488388, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice show of local color and culture!</td>', 'Nice show of local color and culture!', '2007-03-27 07:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490594, 488320, 30982, '<td valign="top">Normally, shots of stuffed toys don''t go over well.  This one, however, is dead on for the challenge and well done.  Good choice picking the sad-eyed ones, good DOF choice, and excellent reference to a craze gone quiet.  I do wonder what happens to all those poor things.  And here they are, begging for food...  (Great idea, great execution.)</td>', 'Normally, shots of stuffed toys don''t go over well.  This one, however, is dead on for the challenge and well done.  Good choice picking the sad-eyed ones, good DOF choice, and excellent reference to a craze gone quiet.  I do wonder what happens to all those poor things.  And here they are, begging for food...  (Great idea, great execution.)', '2007-03-27 07:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490618, 488095, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I like the stopped action of both performers and I find it fun to look at the reactions of the faces in the crowd.  Nicely balanced composition, too.</td>', 'I like this.  I like the stopped action of both performers and I find it fun to look at the reactions of the faces in the crowd.  Nicely balanced composition, too.', '2007-03-27 07:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490620, 488214, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good image for this challenge.  I like the layout, the color, the moving hand (definitely emphasizes the Pop use of turntables these days), and the composition.  And it''s kinda cool to see a turntable to begin with.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very good image for this challenge.  I like the layout, the color, the moving hand (definitely emphasizes the Pop use of turntables these days), and the composition.  And it''s kinda cool to see a turntable to begin with.  Nicely done.', '2007-03-27 07:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490621, 488050, 30982, '<td valign="top">Skateboarding is indeed a good example.  This shot seems just a little too "staged" for my liking.  I''d rather see them in action.</td>', 'Skateboarding is indeed a good example.  This shot seems just a little too "staged" for my liking.  I''d rather see them in action.', '2007-03-27 07:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490623, 488266, 30982, '<td valign="top">Tacky, isn''t it?  My eyes are drawn to the guy with the binoculars, which is kinda cool.  Overall has a bluish cast to me - which is fine - gives it a coldish feeling.</td>', 'Tacky, isn''t it?  My eyes are drawn to the guy with the binoculars, which is kinda cool.  Overall has a bluish cast to me - which is fine - gives it a coldish feeling.', '2007-03-27 07:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490625, 488224, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not here there isn''t!  (Well, OK, maybe in Frankfurt.)  Can''t live without ''em, though.  Well, OK, I can, but would rather not.  I like that you found one with a coffee cup - I''ve not seen that before.  Be judicious in your use of blurring in the background or you can unintentionally approach making the scene look miniaturized.</td>', 'Not here there isn''t!  (Well, OK, maybe in Frankfurt.)  Can''t live without ''em, though.  Well, OK, I can, but would rather not.  I like that you found one with a coffee cup - I''ve not seen that before.  Be judicious in your use of blurring in the background or you can unintentionally approach making the scene look miniaturized.', '2007-03-27 07:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490626, 487270, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not knowing who Bettie Page is/was, I did a quick Google and this is a very good likeness.  The processing is such that she looks cut and pasted onto the background, though, and that probably is hurting your score a bit.</td>', 'Not knowing who Bettie Page is/was, I did a quick Google and this is a very good likeness.  The processing is such that she looks cut and pasted onto the background, though, and that probably is hurting your score a bit.', '2007-03-27 08:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490629, 487742, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, the pocket/purse dogs.  Very spoiled.  Good choice of subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Ah yes, the pocket/purse dogs.  Very spoiled.  Good choice of subject for the challenge.', '2007-03-27 08:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490631, 488328, 30982, '<td valign="top">I hear the devil wears it.  Excellent light and detail.</td>', 'I hear the devil wears it.  Excellent light and detail.', '2007-03-27 08:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
