(3490901, 488087, 30982, '<td valign="top">A Google search yields this:  //www.frmusique.ru/texts/p/perret_pierre/ouvrezlacageauxoiseaux.htm<br/>I suspect there aren''t a lot of DPC users familiar with the tune, nor how it fits pop culture, but I''ll take your word for it.  Interesting composition and intriguing shot.  Not sure about the skew within the frame, though - it kind of looks like you rotated the picture but didn''t crop again after you did that.</td>', 'A Google search yields this:  //www.frmusique.ru/texts/p/perret_pierre/ouvrezlacageauxoiseaux.htmI suspect there aren''t a lot of DPC users familiar with the tune, nor how it fits pop culture, but I''ll take your word for it.  Interesting composition and intriguing shot.  Not sure about the skew within the frame, though - it kind of looks like you rotated the picture but didn''t crop again after you did that.', '2007-03-27 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
