(3490907, 488079, 30982, '<td valign="top">I still don''t have one of those things.  I feel like I really must be missing out on something... I like the within a frame deal going on here, and the neon green/yellow thing gives it a "pop" feeling.</td>', 'I still don''t have one of those things.  I feel like I really must be missing out on something... I like the within a frame deal going on here, and the neon green/yellow thing gives it a "pop" feeling.', '2007-03-27 11:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
