(3490913, 488459, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little mini piano ashtray thing, yes?  Photographed well and I like the shadow/burn bits in the upper left and underneath.</td>', 'Looks like a little mini piano ashtray thing, yes?  Photographed well and I like the shadow/burn bits in the upper left and underneath.', '2007-03-27 12:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490916, 488447, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pop culture or sports culture?  In some ways I guess they''re the same.  And being the next Lance isn''t a bad thing.  I like the perspective with the foreground cyclist sorta cut off, but am glad you kept the fingers on the brake.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Pop culture or sports culture?  In some ways I guess they''re the same.  And being the next Lance isn''t a bad thing.  I like the perspective with the foreground cyclist sorta cut off, but am glad you kept the fingers on the brake.  Nice composition.', '2007-03-27 12:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490918, 488432, 30982, '<td valign="top">The grungish kinda processing works well for this shot.  Definitely a culture unto itself, isn''t it.</td>', 'The grungish kinda processing works well for this shot.  Definitely a culture unto itself, isn''t it.', '2007-03-27 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490919, 487489, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great color, nice light.  Love the shades of red.</td>', 'Great color, nice light.  Love the shades of red.', '2007-03-27 12:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490921, 488299, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - about the 5th Coca Cola can so far - if they only knew how well their product was tied to "Pop Culture"!  I like the layout of the shot and the subtle shading.  Neat how the reflection is bigger than the can, too.</td>', 'Heh - about the 5th Coca Cola can so far - if they only knew how well their product was tied to "Pop Culture"!  I like the layout of the shot and the subtle shading.  Neat how the reflection is bigger than the can, too.', '2007-03-27 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490923, 488442, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wondermous!  I like the centered comp here, particularly with the leading lines.  Love the busy-ness of the menu and the signs in the windows.  Hope folks take enough time to notice the skates!</td>', 'Wondermous!  I like the centered comp here, particularly with the leading lines.  Love the busy-ness of the menu and the signs in the windows.  Hope folks take enough time to notice the skates!', '2007-03-27 12:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490926, 488463, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice graphic image with good light and color.  CDs and DVDs have certainly changed the way we live so I can see the connection.</td>', 'A nice graphic image with good light and color.  CDs and DVDs have certainly changed the way we live so I can see the connection.', '2007-03-27 12:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490929, 488420, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like your subject - the old bottles are awesome.  I''m not thrilled with the border, but I can see what you were trying to do with it.</td>', 'I really like your subject - the old bottles are awesome.  I''m not thrilled with the border, but I can see what you were trying to do with it.', '2007-03-27 12:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490931, 488123, 30982, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I''m familiar with Dora, but I don''t have kids.  The part I think is kinda neat is the "plastic" culture aspect of it.  All shiny, happy plastic people with plastic furniture.</td>', 'Can''t say I''m familiar with Dora, but I don''t have kids.  The part I think is kinda neat is the "plastic" culture aspect of it.  All shiny, happy plastic people with plastic furniture.', '2007-03-27 12:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490933, 488144, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective and good idea to include an actual human.  We do certainly rely on these things.</td>', 'Neat perspective and good idea to include an actual human.  We do certainly rely on these things.', '2007-03-27 12:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490934, 488462, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a cultural icon - and a staple these days.</td>', 'Definitely a cultural icon - and a staple these days.', '2007-03-27 12:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490935, 487619, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now that is cool!  Nifty find, and I like the picture.  Glad you added some background to show it''s really out there somewhere and not in a museum or something.</td>', 'Now that is cool!  Nifty find, and I like the picture.  Glad you added some background to show it''s really out there somewhere and not in a museum or something.', '2007-03-27 12:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490937, 488075, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting find!  A bit static as a standalone shot, but fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Interesting find!  A bit static as a standalone shot, but fits the challenge well.', '2007-03-27 12:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3490939, 488434, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Good action shot, fits the challenge well.', '2007-03-27 12:11:24.000000', NULL, 1);
