(3491557, 488413, 47316, '<td valign="top">Concept is good, as well as lighting. I love the zombie-like expression on his face. Wish the posing was different though. Just holding the objects up like that doesn''t really work for me. Perhaps if you had added more stuff (TV remotes, digital camera, etc) and had him attempting to use it all at once? Or staring at it blankly? I''m not sure but as it is now I don''t find your message as effective as it could be.</td>', 'Concept is good, as well as lighting. I love the zombie-like expression on his face. Wish the posing was different though. Just holding the objects up like that doesn''t really work for me. Perhaps if you had added more stuff (TV remotes, digital camera, etc) and had him attempting to use it all at once? Or staring at it blankly? I''m not sure but as it is now I don''t find your message as effective as it could be.', '2007-03-27 18:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
