(3492009, 488253, 57413, '<td valign="top">This idea is a bit of a reach, but creativity is what photography is all about, so I won''t fault that.  Maybe some toothpicks with little silver gloves would have made this a bit cooler.  Also, lost a bit of focus on the beet root, and there is unnecessary shadow on the background.  If you prop the beet on a pin or toothpick next time, your shadow will be lost if the lighting is right.  Anyway, nice reference to MJ.</td>', 'This idea is a bit of a reach, but creativity is what photography is all about, so I won''t fault that.  Maybe some toothpicks with little silver gloves would have made this a bit cooler.  Also, lost a bit of focus on the beet root, and there is unnecessary shadow on the background.  If you prop the beet on a pin or toothpick next time, your shadow will be lost if the lighting is right.  Anyway, nice reference to MJ.', '2007-03-27 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3492018, 487489, 74979, '<td valign="top">great shot, don''t get the title though</td>', 'great shot, don''t get the title though', '2007-03-27 22:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3492024, 488077, 57413, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Being more of an advocate for classic photography, I think selective coloration is a little on the drift from real photography, but I also there are fans of it, so that''s cool.  I do wish that the shot used a faster shutter, so that more of the people were frozen in time, instead of some blurred by motion.  Nice job all together.  I do like a good McRibb once in a while!</td>', 'Cool shot.  Being more of an advocate for classic photography, I think selective coloration is a little on the drift from real photography, but I also there are fans of it, so that''s cool.  I do wish that the shot used a faster shutter, so that more of the people were frozen in time, instead of some blurred by motion.  Nice job all together.  I do like a good McRibb once in a while!', '2007-03-27 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3492027, 488450, 74979, '<td valign="top">wish you could have gotten the CocaCola logo right side up!</td>', 'wish you could have gotten the CocaCola logo right side up!', '2007-03-27 22:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
