(3495573, 487619, 38032, '<td valign="top">what the - this just popped up on my screen and I wasn''t even on-line  bizarre  what web-site is this?  - but seriously -well, that was serious (the first part) - the lighting and clarity here gives this a convincing animated look.  Quite striking to see at first - of course that''s their artwork I suppose -  the fact that the sky is nice and blue works well - it does come off as a bit slanty but still niiiice.</td>', 'what the - this just popped up on my screen and I wasn''t even on-line  bizarre  what web-site is this?  - but seriously -well, that was serious (the first part) - the lighting and clarity here gives this a convincing animated look.  Quite striking to see at first - of course that''s their artwork I suppose -  the fact that the sky is nice and blue works well - it does come off as a bit slanty but still niiiice.', '2007-03-28 22:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
