(3496140, 487820, 49930, '<td valign="top">I can never understand why Warhol''s cans of soup became so famous - but it did and has become a definitive point of Pop Culture. I do like your version. The colour range and exposure are spot on. 9</td>', 'I can never understand why Warhol''s cans of soup became so famous - but it did and has become a definitive point of Pop Culture. I do like your version. The colour range and exposure are spot on. 9', '2007-03-29 04:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
