(3496144, 488326, 49930, '<td valign="top">Wow - love your backdrop for this. Very effective. I hope the water is PS - I wouldn''t like to be paying for the amp or drums after the water got to them. Great shot - love it. a 10</td>', 'Wow - love your backdrop for this. Very effective. I hope the water is PS - I wouldn''t like to be paying for the amp or drums after the water got to them. Great shot - love it. a 10', '2007-03-29 04:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
