(3496874, 488077, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is great - I like the way it is color-edited to emphasize how the arches appear to take over the mall architecture, and how you highlight the red counters on right to visually lead the eye to the subject.</td>', 'This is great - I like the way it is color-edited to emphasize how the arches appear to take over the mall architecture, and how you highlight the red counters on right to visually lead the eye to the subject.', '2007-03-29 14:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3496879, 488224, 61651, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the "fake miniature" technique - a really nice use of gradual blur in the background building to punch out the foreground.  The couple walking away appear to be stepping off into a different reality.</td>', 'This reminds me of the "fake miniature" technique - a really nice use of gradual blur in the background building to punch out the foreground.  The couple walking away appear to be stepping off into a different reality.', '2007-03-29 14:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
