(3499686, 488370, 75898, '<td valign="top">I would suggest a different setup for a picture composed entirely of album covers.  Maybe all layed flat without any background showing (like a collage).  Or have them all stacked, seperated a bit between each one and offset a bit with the camera pointing down the line; that would give it depth.</td>', 'I would suggest a different setup for a picture composed entirely of album covers.  Maybe all layed flat without any background showing (like a collage).  Or have them all stacked, seperated a bit between each one and offset a bit with the camera pointing down the line; that would give it depth.', '2007-03-30 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
