(3502734, 488457, 20124, '<td valign="top">Awesome! In a Goth Glam sort of way. Technically it''s great as well.<br/>Crystal Clear. No background distractions. Vividly colorful, as they mesh <br/>well together. Definitely not dull. It grabs a viewer''s attention.<br/> Fits theme well. Lighting is almost perfect. ( A tiny bit bright<br/>on the left side of her jaw and cheek.   A creative composition.<br/>  Top 10 entry for sure, and a probable ribbon winner.</td>', 'Awesome! In a Goth Glam sort of way. Technically it''s great as well.Crystal Clear. No background distractions. Vividly colorful, as they mesh well together. Definitely not dull. It grabs a viewer''s attention. Fits theme well. Lighting is almost perfect. ( A tiny bit brighton the left side of her jaw and cheek.   A creative composition.  Top 10 entry for sure, and a probable ribbon winner.', '2007-03-31 21:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502759, 487619, 20124, '<td valign="top">How creative! I wish I thought of that.<br/> <br/>This one is crisply shot. Technically, the only flaw I see is the ground<br/>on both asphalt and red brick are overly bright. The stores in the background<br/>should not be thought of as distractions as they add to the natural<br/>look of  a small town downtown street.<br/>  May the force be with you and your entry.</td>', 'How creative! I wish I thought of that. This one is crisply shot. Technically, the only flaw I see is the groundon both asphalt and red brick are overly bright. The stores in the backgroundshould not be thought of as distractions as they add to the naturallook of  a small town downtown street.  May the force be with you and your entry.', '2007-03-31 21:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
