(3510890, 487618, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the setup, except for the towel or rug -- kind of needs a shiny floor for disco. I like the blue color too, and I remember that often there was a single color used for light. I really like he reflections on the back drop. Focus not quite sharp enough. My camera doesn''t focus well in low light, and maybe that''s the same for yours.</td>', 'I like the setup, except for the towel or rug -- kind of needs a shiny floor for disco. I like the blue color too, and I remember that often there was a single color used for light. I really like he reflections on the back drop. Focus not quite sharp enough. My camera doesn''t focus well in low light, and maybe that''s the same for yours.', '2007-04-02 17:14:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3510898, 487618, 72581, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting. I like how the black backround really brings out the blue spots. I would''ve given it a 7. I think you deserved a MUCH higher score.</td>', 'This is really interesting. I like how the black backround really brings out the blue spots. I would''ve given it a 7. I think you deserved a MUCH higher score.', '2007-04-02 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3510911, 487270, 47534, '<td valign="top">YAAAAAYYYY Michelle!!!!!!!  You have NO idea how proud I am of you!  I wish I had the courage (and the body!) to do something like this!  Your work.... wait a minute!  How come you didn''t come up to the house for this? LOL I woulda let you use the studio!  <br/> <br/>Great job, and I can tell you put a lot of work into this - and if is the one you were asking me about, we gotta talk! (BTW - you have Keith''s attention now ;)<br/> <br/>Bravo girl, bravo!!!!!!!!</td>', 'YAAAAAYYYY Michelle!!!!!!!  You have NO idea how proud I am of you!  I wish I had the courage (and the body!) to do something like this!  Your work.... wait a minute!  How come you didn''t come up to the house for this? LOL I woulda let you use the studio!   Great job, and I can tell you put a lot of work into this - and if is the one you were asking me about, we gotta talk! (BTW - you have Keith''s attention now ;) Bravo girl, bravo!!!!!!!!', '2007-04-02 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3510923, 488274, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, and I remember those days well. The colors are wonderful, and I like the way you have laid out the posters. The peace necklace adds a nice extra dimension to an otherwise flat image, and the way it echoes the corner of one of the posters is a nice touch. The border is GREAT. It makes the whole thing look rather like a poster or trading card. I might have rotated the image 90 degrees clockwise, but it works this way too.</td>', 'I love this shot, and I remember those days well. The colors are wonderful, and I like the way you have laid out the posters. The peace necklace adds a nice extra dimension to an otherwise flat image, and the way it echoes the corner of one of the posters is a nice touch. The border is GREAT. It makes the whole thing look rather like a poster or trading card. I might have rotated the image 90 degrees clockwise, but it works this way too.', '2007-04-02 17:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3511026, 488074, 66384, '<td valign="top">The manikin looks like she is talking to the lady standing out front, and the lady looks like she doesn''t want to hear it. She''s definitely ignoring  the current trends. I like the image.</td>', 'The manikin looks like she is talking to the lady standing out front, and the lady looks like she doesn''t want to hear it. She''s definitely ignoring  the current trends. I like the image.', '2007-04-02 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 0);
