(3512166, 488460, 66384, '<td valign="top">Who''s to say what pop culture really is. It seems to me that basically it''s a popular fad. Certainly retro is "in" these days. And there are several 50s style diners were we live that are quite popular. Mmmmm.... real milk shakes made with real ice cream and an old fashion milk shake blender. <br/> <br/>I like the shot. It says retro to me. I particularly like the reflections. And the processing gives it a special feel, almost as though it was a painted illustration. Was that effect done with High Pass?</td>', 'Who''s to say what pop culture really is. It seems to me that basically it''s a popular fad. Certainly retro is "in" these days. And there are several 50s style diners were we live that are quite popular. Mmmmm.... real milk shakes made with real ice cream and an old fashion milk shake blender.  I like the shot. It says retro to me. I particularly like the reflections. And the processing gives it a special feel, almost as though it was a painted illustration. Was that effect done with High Pass?', '2007-04-02 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 0),
