(3515990, 488071, 3724, '<td valign="top">Hanswors tutorial shows interesting technique &amp; sophisticated use of curve channels.  Explains directly your source method for adjustments.  I think I''ll try it.<br/>Interesting picture - the rendering of mixed lighting is very good, the subtle lime haze, though I know it is there because you said so, is virtually invisible to me, I like the colour results in general.  Composition - remarkably good, in keeping with your usual good eye for emphasizing key architectural and shape relationships.  I agree with everyone below, it is well composed.  Good work!  no vote</td>', 'Hanswors tutorial shows interesting technique & sophisticated use of curve channels.  Explains directly your source method for adjustments.  I think I''ll try it.Interesting picture - the rendering of mixed lighting is very good, the subtle lime haze, though I know it is there because you said so, is virtually invisible to me, I like the colour results in general.  Composition - remarkably good, in keeping with your usual good eye for emphasizing key architectural and shape relationships.  I agree with everyone below, it is well composed.  Good work!  no vote', '2007-04-03 20:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
